{"synopsis":"Yuan Zhenshi tiba-tiba terlempar ke dunia paralel kota Jiangshi. Di dunia ini, berbagai jenis ketakutan dan hal aneh mengintai, dan orang biasa rentan dihadapannya. Namun, Yuan Zhenshi memiliki keistimewaan, yaitu sebuah buku catatan bernama “Urban Legend Chronicle” yang dapat menciptakan cerita legenda urban yang berpengaruh pada kenyataan. Dia memanfaatkan buku tersebut untuk memberantas penjahat dan menangani ancaman-ancaman aneh tersebut. Selain itu, dia juga bisa menyerap kekuatan dari ancaman-ancaman itu sendiri dan menggunakan sihir untuk menghadapinya. Yuan Zhenshi menjadi seorang penjaga yang melawan kekuatan aneh ini, dan bersama dengan teman-temannya, mereka berusaha menghadapi bahaya besar yang mengancam dunia.","alternative_title":"Wǒ, Chuàngzàole Dūshì Chuánshuō!, 我，创造了都市传说！, I, Created Urban Legends, I Created an Urban Legend, Ta Sáng Tạo Truyền Thuyết Đô Thị, Ta Ở Tokyo Sáng Tạo Truyền Thuyết Đô Thị, Ta, Sáng Tạo Ra Đô Thị Truyền Thuyết","author":"役满","artist":"役满","chapters":[{"number":"88","chapter":"88","slug":"347a788e-fa08-47fd-bd15-229bd4fd95be","title":"Chapter 88","date":"2026-07-26"},{"number":"87","chapter":"87","slug":"857b5ca1-747b-4bd5-b722-3a48f1676d8f","title":"Chapter 87","date":"2026-07-20"},{"number":"86","chapter":"86","slug":"85d76575-7464-4d72-adee-d7b8310f8a9c","title":"Chapter 86","date":"2026-07-08"},{"number":"85","chapter":"85","slug":"1c1c84fd-483a-4e6a-b70e-f296dac58911","title":"Chapter 85","date":"2026-07-03"},{"number":"84","chapter":"84","slug":"bba3a497-7527-4242-86ab-5f5cc19866c7","title":"Chapter 84","date":"2026-06-23"},{"number":"83","chapter":"83","slug":"78a0d695-7b01-4710-8e46-fba5abaf9041","title":"Chapter 83","date":"2026-06-10"},{"number":"82","chapter":"82","slug":"4839c901-2fdd-491e-84f6-2bab763282c0","title":"Chapter 82","date":"2026-06-10"},{"number":"81","chapter":"81","slug":"f5439f65-5adb-4cc7-8c23-199d679bd3c0","title":"Chapter 81","date":"2026-02-12"},{"number":"80","chapter":"80","slug